Modification Notice (Apache License, Version 2.0, Section 4(b)):
  All 45 MoE layers (42 backbone LatentMoE layers L01..L42 + 3 bundled MoE
  DSpark draft layers L43..L45 = 23,040 routed experts) of
  baidu/ERNIE-5.5-Flash-Preview-BF16 were quantized to WHT128-HLUT4 (4.125 bpw)
  using FP64 RAREBAL-LDLQ causal reverse-Cholesky error feedback over 524,288
  strictly 8-gram-disjoint calibration tokens. All non-expert spine tensors
  (embeddings, L00 dense FFN, 37 HCA layers, 6 MLA+DSA layers, FlashIndexer
  head routers, mHC mappings, routers, shared experts, MultiMax head, and
  DSpark spine projections) were repacked lossless in BF16/FP32.
